GPU acceleration hooks for triton-vm.

Adds GpuAccelerator trait with optional dispatch for:
- Tip5 batch hashing (Merkle tree leaves)
- iNTT on BFieldElement columns (main table interpolation)
- iNTT on XFieldElement columns (aux table interpolation)

Applied against triton-vm 2.0.0 (crates.io release).
Zero behavioral change when no GPU is registered.

